"**NumPy**: NumPy is the foundational library for numerical computing in "
"Python, providing multidimensional arrays and fast mathematical operations. "
"📚 [NumPy Documentation](https://numpy.org/)"
msgstr ""
"**NumPy**：NumPy は Python における数値計算の基盤ライブラリで、多次元配列と高速な数学演算を提供します。📚 [NumPy "
"ドキュメント](https://numpy.org/)"

